WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:07,060
The formulas in Bailian Heart Sutra and the formulas in Xuanqing Palace seem to match.

2
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,660
Not exactly the same, but complementary.

3
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,060
what is going on

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,060
Could it be that these two books of exercises were originally the same book?

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
But it's not right

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,660
Bailian Heart Sutra is good though

7
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,660
But Xuanqing Palace was at least built by Grandmaster Xiantian

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,860
The levels of the two techniques are too different

9
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,060
How could it be the same book?

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,060
Will the Bailian Heart Sutra be a simplified version?

11
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,660
Even Xuanqing Palace is not complete

12
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,660
It’s just that Xuanqing Palace is more complete than Bailian Heart Sutra.

13
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,660
After completing the Bailian Heart Sutra, combine it with Xuanqing Palace

14
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:35,020
He is the real complete master of Kung Fu

15
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:40,720
It's just a hair's breadth

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,820
Have you really been in retreat these past few months?

17
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,820
There are no ghosts who have not gone out.

18
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:50,820
I didn’t go to Hehuantang and those people didn’t do well.

19
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:51,820
Brat

20
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,820
It’s enlightening

21
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,820
When your father entrusted you to me, he said you had extraordinary self-control.

22
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,820
Let me watch more

23
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,820
Over the years I have watched you running to Hehuantang all day long

24
00:00:58,820 --> 00:00:59,820
I'm so anxious

25
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,820
I was scolded and scolded but couldn’t be beaten and couldn’t let go. I was worried to death.

26
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:04,820
Well now you are finally sensible

27
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:05,820
Waiting for you to break through to the second level

28
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:07,820
I will personally choose a good exercise for you

29
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,820
With your qualifications, you can help me in the future

30
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:10,820
It's not impossible

31
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:12,820
Successor to Hall Master Bai Lian

32
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:13,820
That's naturally good

33
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,850
But if it is the leader of the Demon Cult

34
00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:17,850
Isn't that better, Master?

35
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:19,850
Disciple, I have something to ask you.

36
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:22,420
Where did our Bailian Heart Sutra come from?

37
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:25,670
Why are you asking this suddenly?
